There are lecturers from the University of Naples, Quebec City, Edinburgh, New York, Sao Paulo, Berlin or Bremen.
Evacuation by the police from J.W. Goethe University of Francest makes waves all over the planet.
278 professors and faculty at J.W. Goethe and other higher education institutions from Germany, Europe and North and South America expressed their solidarity with the Protestant students of Campus Westend.
