The majority of occupiers did not take part in the degradation.
Legitimization of protests
The young people of the Verdi trade union in the service sector and the Confederation of German Trade Unions (DGB) stand in solidarity with the students.
Protests are merely a legitimate expression of growing concern for our own future, says Alexander Klein, Regional Secretary for Young People of Verdi.
As for Hessen's Minister of Science Eva Kohne-Harmann (CDU), she took the case for the action taken by the President of the University and the police.
We thank the President of the University.
