Politicians and higher educational institutions wish to facilitate the recognition of examinations between universities and abroad.
In addition, it is committed to organising more flexible common structural requirements for the Bachelor and Degree courses.
At the regional level, there must be no different regulations from one Land to another.
Fewer examinations
