The electricity company Endesa, in collaboration with Ayuntamiento de Barcelona, has created the “Oficina LIVE”.
This is a project aimed at developing and promoting the electric vehicle in the Catalan capital.
Oficina LIVE will identify and co-deally define and coordinate the roadmap for the installation of the electric car in the city and put in place agreements on mobility, by taking steps, coordinating, submitting subsidies, etc.
