The decision to close Saab at the end-of-year if it is not sold is maintained.
Wheel of the Porsche Boxster Spyder
To conceive their last and precious jewellery, Porsche engineers left the Boxster S and succeeded in shaking it by less than 80 kilograms, leaving the scale at only 1,275 kilograms.
